
| File System | Description                                                  |
| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **ext4**    | Default Linux file system on many distributions              |
| **XFS**     | High-performance filesystem, common on RHEL and Amazon Linux |
| **Btrfs**   | Advanced filesystem with snapshots and compression           |
| **FAT32**   | Compatible with many operating systems, limited file size    |
| **NTFS**    | Common on Windows systems                                    |
| **NFS**     | Network File System for shared storage                       |
| **EFS**     | Managed network file system provided by AWS                  |
